prompt_template:
Create one full-bleed {ASPECT_RATIO} poster in the Paddock Pop style.
Render: 2D anime cel-shaded illustration with expressive ink linework, sketch hatching and halftone shadows, flat two-tone fills, glossy highlights, paper grain.
Subject: {SUBJECT}
Action/camera: {SUBJECT_ACTION}
Composition: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Cutout: hero and vehicle share a thin bone-white sticker outline and a thick flat contrasting drop shadow offset down-right.
Title, exact: "{MAIN_TEXT}", spelled letter by letter, enormous custom display lettering in the case's own style (see DESIGN_DIRECTION), partly hidden behind the hero.
Ground colour per case. Palette: bone, ink black, signal vermilion, electric lilac, small sticker yellow; dry-brush slash streaks.
Overlay: checkerboard strip, thin ink inset frame, pill label 'PADDOCK POP', yellow number roundel, yellow warning-triangle sticker, tiny monospace caption.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
